<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Menteri hendaklah, berkenaan dengan setiap tahun kewangan, menyediakan anggaran hasil tahunan berdasarkan perubahan dasar dan perundangan hasil selaras dengan sandaran andaian petunjuk ekonomi dan faktor lain yang berkaitan."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Menteri hendaklah membuat suatu taksiran mengenai potensi kehilangan atau tambahan hasil dan hendaklah menyatakan langkah-langkah yang boleh meminimumkan kehilangan hasil."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@/~part_III__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/34/msa@> .
